OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen brings travel
OL,4,Adisruption and leaves homes without
OL,5,Apower
OL,6,
OL,7,FThousands of homes have been left
OL,8,Fwithout power as Storm Austen hits
OL,9,FWales.
OL,11,FNational Grid previously reported more
OL,12,Fthan 3,000 homes were without power
OL,13,Fbetween Milford Haven, Pembrokeshire,
OL,14,Fand Usk, Monmouthshire, but many have
OL,15,Fsince been reconnected.
OL,17,FAusten, the first named storm of the
OL,18,Fautumn, has brought strong winds -
OL,19,F74mph (119km/h) was recorded at 08:00
OL,20,FBST at Aberporth, Ceredigion.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
