OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen brings travel
OL,4,Adisruption and leaves homes without
OL,5,Apower
OL,6,
OL,7,FA yellow warning for wind is in place
OL,8,Funtil 21:00 in Wales with strong winds
OL,9,Fand gales expected. The Met Office
OL,10,Fwarned there could be power cuts, large
OL,11,Fwaves on the coast and travel delays.
